<title>USA: St Joseph hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with Friday, barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Interior Iowa moved a 104,000 hogs Friday and 18,000 Saturday. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	230-270 lbs    52.00-52.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3	270-290 lbs    50.50-51.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4	pkg 302 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>  Sows - steady/up $3.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2	300-450 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>		    450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3	500-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>		    550-700 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>    Boars:	300-700 lbs    40.00</p>
<p>		    200-300 lbs    41.00</p>
</text>
